Subject: media: 4:2:0 alignment validation in MF VideoEncodeAccelerator

Added the 4:2:0 subsampled format alignment validation in
QueueInput() so that unaligned visible rects are securely and correctly
rejected.

Unit tests added: : {
MediaFoundationVideoEncodeAcceleratorAlignmentTest.*,
MFHelpersAlignmentTest.*
}

Bug: 519693032
Change-Id: Ica81fd85c10ebb9de394c88a2f7fadf33295e961
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7905334
Reviewed-by: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Sangbaek Park <sangbaekpark@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1647964}

